  "description": "CardDAV for Elarion (ADR-0113): address-book sources (ordinary query handlers that decide who sees which address book), ICardDavPublisher publishing Elarion.Contacts contacts into the published-collection store in the handler's transaction, and the address-book properties and reports (addressbook-multiget, addressbook-query with prop-filter, param-filter and text-match) on the WebDAV core, as vCard 3.0 or 4.0, read-only for iOS, macOS, Thunderbird, DAVx5 and Evolution. No ASP.NET Core, no EF Core, no reflection.",
